      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `5b95cc2676d60b0cb7b4c7970331cdd3978e0c0f21720ad2e7242812f86ba721--5.-Victims-of-family-and-domestic-violence-related-offences-Tables-29-to-38-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2025\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 12 of 12\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 588cb5e73bae8fcff97fe67b4f0fe22e2ce4b201b0ecffa4e98293a81d0f961a | missing |\n| \"Table 29\" | ca01f1a52c37574df6c13eb44413c7e313d29990a0ad32478497c9dc0ee69313 | missing |\n| \"Table 30\" | 4e025a2110d6d79cf29e058657076bf6ff2c62f30fff8566b2671939fcac66bb | missing |\n| \"Table 31\" | 6bf36ad65e2c08eacfd654e0c34ef47b1ce2c6e0675354356ba2db0c39fc36d2 | missing |\n| \"Table 32\" | 6fedffc7cb90d44c37c93e5f07972afde6add5c7f1d12a9488e199876495332f | missing |\n| \"Table 33\" | 7cd079914ee7512245e7fdfcc94cb98e9b007d53be3c33d6efce99fb07af49e0 | missing |\n| \"Table 34\" | ab3008a7f8eb0798ecef7db6e3235ca6515b5d1e7eef8a836357697a79524956 | missing |\n| \"Table 35\" | 7163ffed86d7e7548a6706c3377d0009e42191347e27c70b70eb38925c753a89 | missing |\n| \"Table 36\" | 917055480a42c5408c96806b5365f65c7ad80cd0dcb0cd91621cb635cd27e02b | missing |\n| \"Table 37\" | 74036fa88dbf465042215c651add185e48df2b41321c6a6493fab9724eaffaf5 | missing |\n| \"Table 38\" | 29ba20d87cd9a308b976340d348abc2c5270c35abd4e11b99951893edb1a607f | missing |\n| \"Further information\" | 7a66144ef6a0ce5fa7207263a0a4536166b538589598030669e75859fdeb1e63 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
